php-vitexsoftware-abraflexi-datatables for Debian
-------------------------------------------------

AbraFlexi DataTables widget for PHP (Ease / Bootstrap 5).

JavaScript/CSS assets come from Debian package libjs-jquery-datatables and are
served via javascript-common at /javascript/jquery-datatables/.

The previous binary name php-abraflexi-datatables is provided via
Provides/Replaces/Conflicts for upgrades.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Wed, 21 Oct 2026 09:30:00 +0200
